Z||000000||Dan010||11-10-2001||09:15 PM||||can the plastic shifter plate be reconditioned easy??<BR>Is there a paint I should use that is harder<BR>to avoid scratching??<BR> Sure would make the interior look better.<BR>86 gt auto gray interior||||reg||1
Z||000001||deceler8||11-11-2001||10:32 AM||||One thing you can do which I've done is sand off the paint completely, then wet sand and polish the piece. Properly polished, these pieces are a gloss black in color. And it doesn't take very long to do this to all the panels (radio surround, gauge surround) so they all match.||||reg||1
